      "source": [
        "---\n",
        "title: \"Fire, Heat, and the Wildlife Recovery Gap in Australia\"\n",
        "subtitle: \"Does post-fire heat exposure widen the gap between vegetation greening and wildlife recovery?\"\n",
        "author:\n",
        "  - name: \"Hieu Do (SID:540914928)\"\n",
        "  - name: \"Van Duong (SID:530745613)\"\n",
        "  - name: \"Cong Thanh Vu (SID:530784058)\"\n",
        "date: today\n",
